WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.211
Explain safe and responsible decisions when using digital tools

00:00:05.033 --> 00:00:09.658
Computer: an electronic device that processes information. Keyboard: an input tool

00:00:09.658 --> 00:00:12.180
used to type letters and numbers.

00:00:13.033 --> 00:00:17.675
Monitor: the screen where a computer displays information. Responsible use: using a

00:00:17.675 --> 00:00:23.478
device safely and for a clear purpose. Digital skill: an ability to use technology to

00:00:23.478 --> 00:00:24.639
solve a problem.

00:00:25.450 --> 00:00:30.101
Draw and label a digital device and explain one school task it helps you do.
